{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2b2a4f92-3798-4834-ac79-2fb51b70725e",
    "name": "Authentication API",
    "description": "Get yourself authenticated to access the Event Monitoring Service APIs. Use the login endpoint to obtain a JWT token, which is required for all subsequent API calls.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "46619338"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('bearer_token', response.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved to environment:', response.token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('token');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "// {\n//     \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n//     \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n// }\n\n// for dems\n{\n    \"username\": \"ar\",\n    \"password\": \"ar\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://10.10.80.37:3000/auth/login",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["10", "10", "80", "37"],
              "port": "3000",
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate user and obtain JWT token.\n\n### Request Body\n- **username**: User login name\n- **password**: User password\n\n### Response\n- **token**: JWT access token\n- **message**: Success message\n- **expiresIn**: Token expiration time (optional)\n\n### Use Case\nRequired for all subsequent API calls. Token is automatically saved to environment variable."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Authentication endpoints for obtaining JWT tokens."
    }
  ]
}
